        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "Order, Supreme Court, Bronx County (Julia I. Rodriguez, J.), entered July 13, 2012, which denied defendant East 163rd LLC’s motion for summary judgment dismissing the complaint as against it, affirmed, without costs.",
